Figure 5: Naive implementation of a TTT layer with a linear model and online GD in the style of PyTorch. TTT_Layer can be dropped into a larger network like other sequence modeling layers. Training the network will optimize the parameters of Task in TTT_Layer, because both are subclasses of nn.Module. Since Learner is not a subclass of nn.Module, state.model is updated manually in the inner loop for each call of state.train. For simplicity, we sometimes overload model as model.parameters.
